launchpads_by_id_full_metadata.description:
**Description**

This endpoint provides Comprehensive Metrics for Specific Launchpad. It offers details such as the launchpad's `id`, `slug`, `name`, `type`, `rank`, `logo`, `links`, `currentROI`, `athROI`, `projectsCount`, `topProjects1Y`, `avgRaise`, `totalRaised`, `popularCategories`, `blockchains`.

The `timeframe` parameter is required for the request. Available values:
- `1M` – 1 month;
- `3M` – 3 months;
- `6M` – 6 months;
- `1Y` – 1 year;
- `3Y` – 3 years;
- `All` – full data history.

**Pricing**
- Each request costs 1 credit.

### Access & Availability
- ✅ Included in: Pro, Business
- ❌ Not available in: Sandbox, Basic, Advanced
